.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-27T12:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Inside the Pac-12's flex schedule decision to boost Boise State","description":"A look at how the Pac-12 ironed out its first flex week football schedule.","published":"2026-11-27T12:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592934/pac-12-flex-schedule-boise-state-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What rivalries have the biggest stakes? Connelly looks at the end of the season","description":"Among 20 big games, some classic rivalries have fallen down the pecking order.","published":"2026-11-27T12:25:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595179/connelly-rivalry-week-stakes-preview","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best friends Pat Surtain II, Jaylen Waddle ecstatic about reuniting with Broncos","description":"Surtain and Waddle bonded immediately at Alabama six years ago and have embraced the chance to play together again in Denver on a team with Super Bowl hopes.","published":"2026-11-27T11:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595313/pat-surtain-ii-jaylen-waddle-broncos-alabama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5075540/brice-pollock","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Brice Pollock","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:25Z","intro":"Brice Gabriel Pollock (born March 28, 2005) is an American college football cornerback for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Pollock attended Shiloh High School in Snellville, Georgia. As a senior, he had 61 tackles, two interceptions with a sack and caught 11 passes for 196 yards with four receiving touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Mississippi State in 2023, Pollock started three of 11 games and recorded 24 tackles. As a junior in 2024, he started all 12 games and had 48 tackles and one interception. After the season, Pollock entered the transfer portal and transferred to Texas Tech University. He was a starter in 2025."}]}}